<%# "Live updates paused" — BroadcastService's circuit breaker is open, so Turbo
    Stream broadcasts are being dropped and every page is frozen at whatever it
    last rendered. Without this the freeze is indistinguishable from "nothing is
    happening" and the user waits on a page that will never move (issue #86).
    Renders nothing while broadcasts are flowing. %>
<% resume_at = live_updates_paused_until %>
<% if resume_at %>
  <div role="status"
       class="bg-amber-500 text-white text-sm px-4 py-2 text-center shadow-md">
    <span class="font-semibold">⏸ Live updates paused.</span>
    Broadcasts are failing, so this page has stopped updating on its own. Your sessions keep running.
    <span class="opacity-90">
      Updates resume automatically <%= live_updates_resume_phrase(resume_at) %>.
    </span>
    <%= link_to "Health details", health_dashboard_path, class: "underline font-medium" %>
  </div>
<% end %>
